    #   Scale ratio: 10¹⁹ / 10⁻³⁷ = 10⁵⁶ (56 orders of magnitude!)
    #
    #   This reflects [SCm]'s influence being MORE pronounced at smaller
    #   scales (atomic interactions, proton stability) and diminishing at
    #   larger scales (stellar dynamics).
